# map auto-unpacks the payload of a Variant before iterating
# variant-payload creates a Variant whose payload is a Seq
# map should unpack the Seq and apply the function to each element
[map [+ _ 1] [variant-payload "Wrapper" [1 2 3]]]
# === out will be added by just update-corpus
=== out
Dict({0: Int(2), 1: Int(3), 2: Int(4)})
